"'''Tintop'''" was the nickname of a [[stormtrooper]] who served in [[Foot Patrol 7]] who were stationed in [[Mos Eisley]] on [[Tatooine]]. [[Gender|His]] fellow [[trooper]]s considered him somewhat irritating.<ref name="Born in the Storm" />

